seg-dbe54e7cc800 = <b>MODELLED</b> The <c1/> report no longer rests its denial contour on one scalar. It emits the full measured wanted-signal C/N₀ distribution over the per-satellite t. Oracle (InternalConsistency): Internal consistency against the engine's own forward functions, which is all this capability can honestly claim. Every contour point is a closed-form inversion, and each inversion is checked by pushing its answer back through the FORWARD function the report's own rows were scored with: the J/S column through jamming::effective_cn0_dbhz (which must return tracking_threshold_dbhz to < { "1e-9" } dB-Hz), the standoff column

